<title>UK: Greenwich Lewisham Rail prices 165 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Greenwich Lewisham Rail prices 165 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Greenwich Lewisham Rail Link Plc's 165 million stg 24-year bond, announced earlier, has been priced, lead manager BZW said on Friday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT   *165 MLN STG   COUPON     9.375     MATURITY    11.OCT.20</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.354   PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    100.354   SPREAD	+130 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.75 PCT GILT DUE 2017</p>
<p> NOTES     *AMORTISES IN UNEQUAL SEMI-ANNUAL INSTALMENTS FROM</p>
<p>		11.APR.06UNTIL MATURITY TO GIVE AN AVERAGE LIFE</p>
<p>		OF 16.2 YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
